#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:2
msgid "Channel callbacks"
msgstr "Kanalåteranrop"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:4
msgid ""
"The backend object handed to :func:`protocol.register` is a Python class. "
"The protocol library doesn't ask the class which methods it implements; it "
"inspects the instance and wires the ones it finds. That introspection is "
"what makes the backend interface flexible: the smallest useful backend is "
"two methods, the most elaborate is twelve, and the application opts in to "
"each capability one method at a time."
msgstr ""
"Backend-objektet som skickas till :func:`protocol.register` är en Python-"
"klass. Protokollbiblioteket frågar inte klassen vilka metoder den "
"implementerar; det inspekterar instansen och kopplar in dem den hittar. Den "
"introspektionen är vad som gör backend-gränssnittet flexibelt: den minsta "
"användbara backenden är två metoder, den mest avancerade är tolv, och "
"applikationen ansluter sig till varje förmåga en metod i taget."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:13
msgid "The introspection rules"
msgstr "Introspektionsreglerna"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:15
msgid ""
"When :func:`protocol.register` runs, the library walks a fixed list of "
"callable names and binds each one it finds on the backend instance:"
msgstr ""
"När :func:`protocol.register` körs går biblioteket igenom en fast lista med "
"anropbara namn och binder varje sådant som det hittar på backend-instansen:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:19
msgid ""
"Adding ``read`` to the class flips ``CHANNEL_FLAG_READ`` on. A host call to "
":meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_read` only reaches the backend if this "
"flag is set."
msgstr ""
"Att lägga till ``read`` i klassen slår på ``CHANNEL_FLAG_READ``\\ . Ett "
"värdanrop till :meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_read` når bara backenden"
" om denna flagga är satt."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:22
msgid ""
"Adding ``write`` flips ``CHANNEL_FLAG_WRITE`` on, enabling "
":meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_write`."
msgstr ""
"Att lägga till ``write`` slår på ``CHANNEL_FLAG_WRITE`` och aktiverar "
":meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_write`\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:24
msgid ""
"Adding ``lock`` and ``unlock`` flips ``CHANNEL_FLAG_LOCK`` on, enabling the "
"host to lock the channel for a multi-packet atomic read."
msgstr ""
"Att lägga till ``lock`` och ``unlock`` slår på ``CHANNEL_FLAG_LOCK`` och "
"låter värden låsa kanalen för en atomär läsning över flera paket."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:27
msgid ""
"Adding ``poll`` lets the host ask \"is anything ready?\" cheaply, without "
"forcing a full read."
msgstr ""
"Att lägga till ``poll`` låter värden billigt fråga \"finns det något "
"klart?\" utan att tvinga fram en fullständig läsning."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:30
msgid ""
"Missing methods are not errors -- the protocol library just leaves the "
"corresponding capability disabled. A backend with only ``size`` and ``read``"
" is perfectly valid; it's a read-only data channel."
msgstr ""
"Saknade metoder är inte fel -- protokollbiblioteket lämnar bara motsvarande "
"förmåga inaktiverad. En backend med endast ``size`` och ``read`` är helt "
"giltig; det är en skrivskyddad datakanal."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:35
msgid "A read-only sensor channel"
msgstr "En skrivskyddad sensorkanal"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:37
msgid ""
"A sensor channel that publishes a fresh reading every time the host asks, "
"refusing host writes, exercises four of the callbacks::"
msgstr ""
"En sensorkanal som publicerar en färsk avläsning varje gång värden frågar "
"och vägrar skrivningar från värden använder fyra av återanropen::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:68
msgid "Walking through what each method does:"
msgstr "En genomgång av vad varje metod gör:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:70
msgid ""
"``poll`` returns the freshness flag. The host calls it before reading and "
"skips the read entirely when it returns :data:`False`. That saves the round-"
"trip cost for \"no new data yet.\""
msgstr ""
"``poll`` returnerar färskhetsflaggan. Värden anropar den före läsning och "
"hoppar över läsningen helt när den returnerar :data:`False`\\ . Det sparar "
"in tur-och-retur-kostnaden för \"ingen ny data ännu\"."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:74
msgid ""
"``size`` regenerates the buffer on demand and reports its length. Doing the "
"sampling here means the backend doesn't need a background task -- a host "
"call drives every measurement."
msgstr ""
"``size`` regenererar bufferten vid behov och rapporterar dess längd. Att "
"utföra samplingen här innebär att backenden inte behöver någon "
"bakgrundsuppgift -- ett värdanrop driver varje mätning."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:77
msgid ""
"``read`` returns a slice of the buffer. The protocol library may call it "
"more than once when the buffer is larger than the negotiated max payload; "
"the ``offset`` argument walks through the fragments."
msgstr ""
"``read`` returnerar en del av bufferten. Protokollbiblioteket kan anropa den"
" mer än en gång när bufferten är större än den förhandlade maximala "
"nyttolasten; argumentet ``offset`` går igenom fragmenten."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:81
msgid ""
"No ``write`` means host writes are refused at the framing layer, before the "
"backend is involved."
msgstr ""
"Avsaknad av ``write`` innebär att skrivningar från värden avvisas i "
"ramnivån, innan backenden är inblandad."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:85
msgid "The full callback set"
msgstr "Den fullständiga uppsättningen återanrop"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:87
msgid "For reference, every method the library looks for on a backend:"
msgstr "För referens, varje metod som biblioteket letar efter på en backend:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:93
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metod"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:94
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Returnerar"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:95
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Syfte"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:96
msgid "``init(self)``"
msgstr "``init(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:97
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:136
msgid "object"
msgstr "objekt"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:98
msgid ""
"Optional one-shot initialisation when the channel first binds to a host. "
"Return any non-:data:`None` value on success."
msgstr ""
"Valfri engångsinitialisering när kanalen först binds till en värd. Returnera"
" valfritt värde som inte är :data:`None` vid lyckat resultat."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:101
msgid "``poll(self)``"
msgstr "``poll(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:102
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:105
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:108
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:140
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:103
msgid "Return :data:`True` when data is available."
msgstr "Returnera :data:`True` när data är tillgänglig."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:104
msgid "``lock(self)``"
msgstr "``lock(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:106
msgid "Acquire the channel for an atomic multi-packet transfer."
msgstr "Reservera kanalen för en atomär överföring över flera paket."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:107
msgid "``unlock(self)``"
msgstr "``unlock(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:109
msgid "Release a prior ``lock``."
msgstr "Frigör ett tidigare ``lock``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:110
msgid "``size(self)``"
msgstr "``size(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:111
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:127
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:132
msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:112
msgid "Number of bytes currently readable from the channel."
msgstr "Antal byte som för närvarande kan läsas från kanalen."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:113
msgid "``shape(self)``"
msgstr "``shape(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:114
msgid "tuple"
msgstr "tuple"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:115
msgid ""
"Up to four integers describing the data structure (e.g. image height, width,"
" byte count). Used by the host to unpack typed buffers."
msgstr ""
"Upp till fyra heltal som beskriver datastrukturen (t.ex. bildhöjd, bredd, "
"antal byte). Används av värden för att packa upp typade buffertar."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:118
msgid "``read(self, offset, size)``"
msgstr "``read(self, offset, size)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:119
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:123
msgid "bytes"
msgstr "bytes"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:120
msgid ""
"Return up to *size* bytes starting at *offset*. Called once per fragment "
"when the payload exceeds the negotiated max."
msgstr ""
"Returnera upp till *size* byte med start vid *offset*\\ . Anropas en gång "
"per fragment när nyttolasten överskrider det förhandlade maximumet."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:122
msgid "``readp(self, offset, size)``"
msgstr "``readp(self, offset, size)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:124
msgid ""
"Zero-copy variant of ``read``: the buffer's memory must stay valid for the "
"duration of the transfer."
msgstr ""
"Nollkopieringsvariant av ``read``\\ : buffertens minne måste förbli giltigt "
"under hela överföringen."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:126
msgid "``write(self, offset, data)``"
msgstr "``write(self, offset, data)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:128
msgid ""
"Host wrote *data* at *offset*. ``data`` is a ``bytearray`` view into the "
"protocol layer's receive buffer -- copy out what you want to keep before "
"returning."
msgstr ""
"Värden skrev *data* vid *offset*\\ . ``data`` är en ``bytearray``\\ -vy in i"
" protokollagrets mottagningsbuffert -- kopiera ut det du vill behålla innan "
"du returnerar."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:131
msgid "``ioctl(self, cmd, length, arg)``"
msgstr "``ioctl(self, cmd, length, arg)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:133
msgid ""
"Application-defined opcode outside the read/write model. Negative return is "
"an error."
msgstr ""
"Applikationsdefinierad opkod utanför läs-/skrivmodellen. Negativ retur är "
"ett fel."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:135
msgid "``flush(self)``"
msgstr "``flush(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:137
msgid ""
"Drop any buffered data. Called when the host wants to reset the channel."
msgstr "Kasta all buffrad data. Anropas när värden vill återställa kanalen."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:139
msgid "``is_active(self)``"
msgstr "``is_active(self)``"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:141
msgid ""
"Only meaningful on backends that represent a physical transport (the built-"
"in USB channels). Application channels don't need this."
msgstr ""
"Endast meningsfull på backendar som representerar en fysisk transport (de "
"inbyggda USB-kanalerna). Applikationskanaler behöver inte detta."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/channel-callbacks.rst:145
msgid ""
"That's the entire backend interface. Twelve method names, all optional, and "
"the protocol library decides what each channel can do based on which ones "
"are present."
msgstr ""
"Det är hela backend-gränssnittet. Tolv metodnamn, alla valfria, och "
"protokollbiblioteket avgör vad varje kanal kan göra utifrån vilka som finns."
